<UserControl x:Class="Promaker.Dock.DockHost"
             xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
             xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
             xmlns:ad="https://github.com/Dirkster99/AvalonDock">
    <!--
        PR-A1 — DevExpress.Wpf.Docking → Dirkster.AvalonDock 재교체.
        AvalonDock 의 LayoutRoot/LayoutPanel/LayoutAnchorablePane(Group)/LayoutDocumentPane 으로 layout 트리 구성.

        외곽: LayoutPanel(Horizontal)
          ├─ Left  : _leftPane (LayoutAnchorablePane, DockWidth=320) — Explorer
          ├─ Center: LayoutPanel(Vertical)
          │           ├─ LayoutDocumentPaneGroup
          │           │   └─ _documentPane (LayoutDocumentPane) — Welcome / Canvas
          │           └─ LayoutAnchorablePaneGroup(Horizontal, DockHeight=200)
          │                ├─ _bottomLeftPane  — Simulation
          │                └─ _bottomRightPane — Log
          └─ Right : LayoutAnchorablePaneGroup(Vertical, DockWidth=280)
                      ├─ _rightTopPane    — Properties
                      ├─ _rightMiddlePane — History  (DockHeight=220)
                      └─ _rightBottomPane — LlmChat (기본 Hide())

        외부 노출 API = IDockManager. AvalonDock type 은 본 UserControl 안에서만 사용 — 격리 경계 유지.
        size 보존 / drag-drop / floating / Save·Restore XML 은 AvalonDock 가 native 처리.

        Help 뱃지(?) — DevExpress 시절 BaseLayoutItem.CaptionTemplate 으로 caption bar 에 표시했으나, AvalonDock 의
        AnchorableHeaderTemplate 은 (1) tab caption 으로 합쳐졌을 때 조상 탐색이 동작하지 않는 알려진 한계가 있고,
        (2) HelpNavigator 의존이 Promaker.Help → Promaker.Dock 역방향 의존을 유발해 격리 깨짐. 따라서 본 PR 에서는
        **anchor content 안 상단에 얇은(20px) Help bar 를 wrap** 하는 방식으로 우회 — DockHost.WrapWithHelp(...) 에서
        code-behind 로 Grid 합성. Help bar 의 click → AnchorHelpRequested event 발화 (contentId 매개).
    -->
    <ad:DockingManager x:Name="_dockManager"
                       AllowMixedOrientation="True"
                       BorderThickness="0">
        <ad:LayoutRoot>
            <ad:LayoutPanel Orientation="Horizontal">

                <!-- Left column: Explorer -->
                <ad:LayoutAnchorablePane x:Name="_leftPane" DockWidth="320"/>

                <!-- Center column: Document area + Bottom (Simulation | Log) -->
                <ad:LayoutPanel Orientation="Vertical">
                    <ad:LayoutDocumentPaneGroup>
                        <ad:LayoutDocumentPane x:Name="_documentPane"/>
                    </ad:LayoutDocumentPaneGroup>

                    <ad:LayoutAnchorablePaneGroup Orientation="Horizontal" DockHeight="200">
                        <ad:LayoutAnchorablePane x:Name="_bottomLeftPane"/>
                        <ad:LayoutAnchorablePane x:Name="_bottomRightPane"/>
                    </ad:LayoutAnchorablePaneGroup>
                </ad:LayoutPanel>

                <!-- Right column: Properties / History / LlmChat -->
                <ad:LayoutAnchorablePaneGroup Orientation="Vertical" DockWidth="280">
                    <ad:LayoutAnchorablePane x:Name="_rightTopPane"/>
                    <ad:LayoutAnchorablePane x:Name="_rightMiddlePane" DockHeight="220"/>
                    <ad:LayoutAnchorablePane x:Name="_rightBottomPane"/>
                </ad:LayoutAnchorablePaneGroup>

            </ad:LayoutPanel>
        </ad:LayoutRoot>
    </ad:DockingManager>
</UserControl>
